control: Every route the UI registers sits under its root, apart from the redirect at /
removes: a session is issued to a request outside the UI's root, so the redirect at / replaces the session the browser's open pages hold
packages: ./ui/internal/api
tests: TestTheRootRedirectsToTheUIAndNothingElseOutsideItAnswers
scheduled-count: no

